      "text": "beautiful land, eight days’ journey from land of Nephi, Mosiah 23:3–4. given name, Mosiah 23:19. people multiply, prosper, build city of Helam, Mosiah 23:20. Lamanites invade, Mosiah 23:25. Lamanites take possession of Helam, Mosiah 23:29. Amulon and his brethren discover Helam while searching for land of Nephi, Mosiah 23:35. Lamanites set guards around Helam, Mosiah 23:37. Lamanites bring families to Helam, Mosiah 23:38. Amulon appointed king over Helam, Mosiah 23:39. people of Alma1 flee from Helam, Mosiah 24:18–20. remember the captivity of thy fathers in land of Helam, Mosiah 27:16. Amalekites and Amulonites stir up Lamanites in Helam against people of Anti-Nephi-Lehi, Alma 24:1.",
